  "title": "Buffer: just call ws_buffer_clean() in ws_buffer_remove_start().",
  "description": "We now have a routine whose sole job is to reset a Buffer; call that if\nws_buffer_remove_start() has removed everything in the buffer.\n\nAdd a comment indicating that's what we're doing.\n\nWhile we're at it, wrap one #ifndef SOME_FUNCTIONS_ARE_DEFINES/#endif\npair around the routines that may be implemented as macros in buffer.h,\nrather than wrapping each one individually.  That matches what we do in\nthe header.",
